# Normalise to LF in the repository. The site is built on Linux (Vercel); checking in CRLF from
# Windows makes every file look modified to the next machine and breaks shebangs in .husky/.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
